 * Meta:  Free 2026 Medicare Part D drug cost estimator. See your
 *        cost-tier proxy and the new $2,100 IRA cap. No signup.   [111 chars]
 *
 * 2026 Verified Figures — confirmed against CMS August 15 2026:
 *   Part D Out-of-Pocket Maximum (IRA): $2,100/year [CMS 2026 MA & Part D Rate Announcement]
 *   Part D National Base Premium      : $38.99/month [CMS 2026]
 *   Part D Maximum Deductible         : $590/year    [CMS 2026]
 *   Donut Hole (Coverage Gap)         : 100% ELIMINATED in 2026
 *   Medicare Prescription Payment Plan: M3P monthly spreading available
 *
 * Compliance (Prompt 2 Section 0):
 *   [x] Tier-proxy cost estimator with prominent Medicare.gov Plan Finder handoff
 *   [x] Enriched educational content & glossary of abbreviations/terminologies
