  <p>This prescription drug cost estimator is for educational purposes only. Seniors Audit is not an insurance agency and does not sell or broker prescription drug plans. Medicare Part D formulary tiers, negotiated drug prices, and pharmacy networks vary significantly by insurance company, county, and calendar year. The $2,100 out-of-pocket maximum is a federal statutory cap established by the Inflation Reduction Act of 2022. For exact penny-for-penny pricing of your specific medications and dosages, use the official tool at <a href="https://www.medicare.gov/plan-compare" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">medicare.gov/plan-compare</a>. For free, unbiased, state-certified counseling, contact your local State Health Insurance Assistance Program (SHIP) at <a href="https://www.shiphelp.org" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">shiphelp.org</a> or <strong>1-877-839-2675</strong>.</p>
